WEBVTT

01:33.232 --> 01:35.986
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:36.086 --> 01:37.888
(Adapted from the novel "A City, Waiting for You" by Jiuyuexi)

01:37.988 --> 01:40.791
(Episode 6)

01:43.093 --> 01:44.492
-You're back. -You're back, Dr. Xu.

01:55.304 --> 01:57.473
Dr. Xu, that was impressive today.

01:57.607 --> 01:59.028
You saved someone whose heart had stopped due to a heart attack.

01:59.109 --> 02:00.176
I was just doing my job.

02:03.149 --> 02:05.664
The family members of the patient kept thanking you.

02:05.749 --> 02:07.990
Do you feel a sense of accomplishment being a doctor now?

02:08.070 --> 02:10.269
Don't you find the gratitude from the family touching?

02:12.230 --> 02:13.463
They will soon forget.

02:13.924 --> 02:16.279
No, they wouldn't. If a police officer saved you,

02:16.360 --> 02:17.979
would you forget about him quickly too?

02:34.943 --> 02:35.979
Yes.

02:37.304 --> 02:38.983
Humans are forgetful creatures by nature.

02:39.416 --> 02:40.696
Have you ever seen

02:41.116 --> 02:43.495
a patient come back to thank their doctor after going home?

02:48.892 --> 02:50.133
She's such a weirdo.

02:54.531 --> 02:55.564
Bye, Dr. Xu.

02:55.644 --> 02:57.263
-Bye, Dr. Xu. -Bye.

02:59.609 --> 03:02.297
Actually, I think being thanked once at the time should be enough.

03:02.773 --> 03:05.568
Besides, don't you feel proud when patients and their families

03:05.649 --> 03:06.850
express their gratitude?

03:07.611 --> 03:10.896
For me, treating patients and saving lives is just my job duty.

03:11.410 --> 03:13.743
So, you think this is merely fulfilling your duty

03:13.990 --> 03:15.809
and you don't need others' gratitude.

03:17.929 --> 03:20.049
I find your attitude

03:20.369 --> 03:21.369
quite unique.

03:22.789 --> 03:25.428
Whether or not the patients feel grateful is their choice,

03:25.964 --> 03:27.364
and it doesn't affect my attitude.

03:28.131 --> 03:30.531
Medicine as a scientific field has its limitations.

03:30.867 --> 03:33.357
If a patient's condition goes beyond the limits of medicine,

03:34.204 --> 03:36.144
even the most skilled doctor can't do anything.

03:36.590 --> 03:37.802
We are just ordinary people.

03:38.044 --> 03:39.084
We have no superpowers.

03:39.222 --> 03:40.237
That's the reality.

03:41.845 --> 03:42.884
Dr. Xu,

03:43.480 --> 03:45.320
you really are an unlikable doctor.

03:46.283 --> 03:49.189
We already have a likable doctor like you in our hospital, Dr. Yang.

03:49.452 --> 03:50.561
We don't need one more like me.

03:50.642 --> 03:52.943
Xu Qin, what does that mean?

03:53.023 --> 03:54.257
Are you mocking me?

03:54.503 --> 03:56.223
I genuinely meant it as a compliment.

04:06.203 --> 04:07.470
What are you doing here?

04:07.703 --> 04:08.814
I'm busy as hell here.

04:09.044 --> 04:10.363
I missed you.

04:11.074 --> 04:13.283
I was just in the area. So, I dropped by to visit you.

04:13.583 --> 04:14.742
As if.

04:15.345 --> 04:17.801
I mean it. It's been a few days since I saw you. And I missed you.

04:17.881 --> 04:18.982
I want to talk to you.

04:19.182 --> 04:20.849
I don't have time. Go somewhere else.

04:23.520 --> 04:24.741
I really need to talk to you.

04:24.821 --> 04:25.843
I need a favor.

04:26.883 --> 04:28.123
What favor do you need from me?

04:28.529 --> 04:30.002
I'm working on a project recently.

04:30.227 --> 04:31.780
I wanted to ask you to invest in it.

04:34.736 --> 04:35.777
Are you mocking me?

04:36.500 --> 04:37.773
Don't you have money yourself?

04:39.569 --> 04:40.569
I'll be honest with you.

04:41.471 --> 04:42.590
The thing is,

04:42.906 --> 04:45.006
I'm doing this for my ex-girlfriend, Zhan Xiao Yao.

04:45.142 --> 04:46.142
As you know,

04:46.409 --> 04:49.146
she hasn't been doing anything practical these past couple of years.

04:49.336 --> 04:50.336
So, I thought...

04:50.614 --> 04:53.302
So, you thought of taking advantage of me.

04:54.244 --> 04:55.630
Come on, don't put it like that.

04:55.810 --> 04:57.209
You're a big investor, right?

04:57.847 --> 05:00.297
Just let a little bit profit slip through your fingers to us.

05:00.703 --> 05:01.703
Besides,

05:02.092 --> 05:04.863
I thought it would be fun for a few of us to do something together.

05:05.124 --> 05:06.124
Wouldn't it be great?

05:07.164 --> 05:08.524
The money that she needs,

05:08.717 --> 05:10.277
I can lend it to her personally.

05:10.657 --> 05:11.917
Leave me out of your project.

05:12.002 --> 05:13.161
I'm not interested

05:13.503 --> 05:14.670
in small projects like this.

05:15.677 --> 05:17.276
-You... -I have some work to attend to.

05:18.308 --> 05:19.308
You should go.

05:20.577 --> 05:22.022
I'm going to finish my tea first.

05:22.103 --> 05:23.237
Finish it alone then.

05:32.656 --> 05:33.897
Recently, Qin has been...

05:36.760 --> 05:39.390
If you have something to say, just spit it out, otherwise, leave.

05:45.569 --> 05:47.336
Weren't you just saying that you're busy?

05:47.971 --> 05:49.091
Now you suddenly have time?

05:54.177 --> 05:55.538
She met with Song Yan.

05:56.156 --> 05:57.516
Aren't you afraid

05:57.614 --> 05:59.022
that they would get back together?

05:59.863 --> 06:00.863
She won't.

06:01.944 --> 06:02.944
Right.

06:04.154 --> 06:06.184
With Aunt Fu pressing down on her like a mountain,

06:06.783 --> 06:08.943
she can only suppress herself more and more.

06:09.270 --> 06:10.783
That's why I'm worried

06:11.161 --> 06:12.401
about her mental well-being.

06:14.002 --> 06:15.403
I think Qin Qin is doing fine.

06:16.933 --> 06:18.420
That's according to your standards.

06:19.103 --> 06:20.103
The way I see it,

06:20.277 --> 06:21.397
you also have issues.

06:23.440 --> 06:24.440
Both of you

06:24.517 --> 06:26.277
are living an unhappy life.

06:27.711 --> 06:28.912
And there's nothing you can do about it.

06:28.997 --> 06:30.510
You have such a mother, after all.

06:31.390 --> 06:32.390
I mean,

06:32.430 --> 06:33.850
look at you young people,

06:34.463 --> 06:37.424
you have everything, but you just can't live happily.

06:38.184 --> 06:39.544
It's always cloudy and gloomy.

06:40.657 --> 06:41.657
What's the point?

06:52.202 --> 06:53.428
Qin doesn't have any friends

06:53.796 --> 06:55.236
since she came back.

06:55.964 --> 06:56.964
She's all alone.

06:58.223 --> 06:59.663
Our girl has grown up.

07:00.143 --> 07:01.143
She doesn't share

07:01.544 --> 07:03.304
her intimate thoughts with me anymore.

07:04.483 --> 07:07.008
And of course, she never shared them with you either.

07:09.064 --> 07:10.064
Tonight,

07:10.329 --> 07:11.849
invite her to my place for a drink.

07:12.016 --> 07:13.095
I'll also invite Xiao Yao.

07:13.923 --> 07:15.092
Introduce them to each other.

07:15.184 --> 07:16.184
Let them be friends.

07:17.160 --> 07:18.746
Their personalities are too different.

07:19.051 --> 07:20.260
They can't become friends.

07:21.097 --> 07:23.017
The greater the differences,

07:23.143 --> 07:24.943
the more likely they can become good friends.

07:25.769 --> 07:26.769
Want to bet on it?

07:27.828 --> 07:29.430
-What a waste of time. -It's true.

07:29.984 --> 07:30.984
I mean, look at us.

07:31.783 --> 07:32.783
Haven't we

07:32.970 --> 07:34.251
been friends for so long?

07:34.611 --> 07:36.792
Why? You have a problem with this?

07:36.997 --> 07:38.076
No.

07:38.423 --> 07:39.983
But you talk too much nonsense,

07:40.350 --> 07:41.429
and it's hurting my ears.

07:41.504 --> 07:42.504
Just go already.

07:46.690 --> 07:47.690
All right.

07:56.816 --> 07:57.816
Cheer up.

07:57.903 --> 07:58.903
Take care of yourself.

07:59.302 --> 08:00.748
Otherwise, I'll feel sorry for you.

09:25.822 --> 09:26.822
Allow me to introduce.

09:27.290 --> 09:28.290
Qin.

09:28.625 --> 09:30.503
This is Xu Qin, my sister.

09:30.764 --> 09:32.540
This is Zhan Xiao Yao, my ex-girlfriend.

09:33.343 --> 09:34.343
Hi.

09:34.965 --> 09:35.965
Hi.

09:37.801 --> 09:38.801
Yan Chen.

09:41.064 --> 09:42.244
You two really are siblings.

09:42.506 --> 09:43.750
You are both aloof and quiet.

09:50.080 --> 09:52.026
I can't stand your obsession with cleanliness.

09:52.383 --> 09:53.864
Are your eyes microscopes?

09:54.150 --> 09:55.784
Everything seems dirty to you, huh?

09:56.619 --> 09:58.622
-Mind your own business. -You're quite a character.

09:58.688 --> 10:01.191
Xiao Yi Xiao, you're always poking your nose into others' affairs.

10:01.263 --> 10:02.489
You can't tell me what to do.

10:03.723 --> 10:04.814
Where's your new boyfriend?

10:04.894 --> 10:06.563
Bring him over and let me check on him for you.

10:06.629 --> 10:08.650
I didn't see you bringing your girlfriend either.

10:08.731 --> 10:10.413
-We broke up. -Congratulations.

10:13.170 --> 10:14.170
Get us a glass.

10:24.144 --> 10:25.503
Xu Qin, do you have a boyfriend?

10:26.463 --> 10:27.463
No.

10:27.651 --> 10:29.850
You have to get one. Don't be like Meng Yan Chen.

10:30.153 --> 10:32.420
Every time I see him, I think he's about to become a monk.

10:32.477 --> 10:34.870
I'm afraid I'll have to visit him at the temple next time.

10:35.158 --> 10:36.158
Ms. Zhan,

10:36.651 --> 10:38.010
return the investment fund to me.

10:38.463 --> 10:40.182
Meng Yan Chen is like a god among mortals.

10:40.263 --> 10:42.224
No one in this world is worthy of you.

10:42.799 --> 10:44.782
Does that mean I don't have to repay that money now?

10:44.863 --> 10:47.743
Xu Qin, how about we find a boyfriend right here today?

10:47.983 --> 10:49.223
Don't corrupt my sister.

10:51.108 --> 10:52.108
Xu Qin.

10:53.209 --> 10:54.209
Here's to our first meeting.

10:54.243 --> 10:55.590
I'll empty the glass. Be my guest.

11:05.675 --> 11:06.835
-I like you. -Slow down.

11:07.357 --> 11:09.712
Can you handle your drinks? Don't get drunk right away.

11:09.793 --> 11:11.377
Or Meng Ya Chen is going to scold me.

11:11.662 --> 11:13.343
I don't think you can outdrink me.

11:13.703 --> 11:15.424
Well, let's find out about that today.

11:15.703 --> 11:16.703
Xiao Yi Xiao.

11:18.795 --> 11:19.795
Bring us shot glasses.

11:20.237 --> 11:21.237
Yes, sir.

11:30.870 --> 11:32.721
-You girls are really doing this? -Yes.

11:32.983 --> 11:33.693
All right.

11:33.717 --> 11:34.810
-Here. -We will start first.

11:36.463 --> 11:37.463
Easy there.

11:43.126 --> 11:44.326
Easy, girls.

11:44.424 --> 11:45.744
Xiao Yi Xiao, stop pulling me.

11:45.824 --> 11:47.023
I'm not drunk.

11:47.103 --> 11:48.103
You are unbelievable.

11:48.343 --> 11:49.576
Why didn't you stop if you knew you couldn't handle it?

11:49.666 --> 11:51.387
How could I possibly lose?

11:51.634 --> 11:52.632
Zhan Xiao Yao,

11:52.656 --> 11:54.023
when it comes to embarrassing yourself, no one can beat you.

11:54.104 --> 11:55.464
You lost.

11:55.639 --> 11:57.378
No, I'm not, Xu Qin. Let's keep drinking.

11:58.583 --> 11:59.583
Sit tight.

11:59.703 --> 12:00.984
My car is over there. I'll take her home.

12:01.177 --> 12:02.755
-Okay, I'll take this one home then. -Xu Qin...

12:02.836 --> 12:04.630
I want to sleep with Xu Qin.

12:04.863 --> 12:06.423
Get up. Listen, Zhan Xiao Yao,

12:06.503 --> 12:07.824
you're now blacklisted by my bar.

12:07.904 --> 12:09.272
Give me a hand.

12:09.353 --> 12:10.353
Xu Qin!

12:11.211 --> 12:13.743
I don't want to go back. I want to drink!

12:13.983 --> 12:15.024
Just stay still.

12:15.424 --> 12:16.424
We're here.

12:17.024 --> 12:18.024
Get in.

12:20.230 --> 12:21.230
Hold the bag.

12:27.857 --> 12:29.983
Excuse me. Is this your car?

12:30.540 --> 12:31.540
Yes. Why?

12:32.223 --> 12:34.503
I scratched it by accident.

12:35.278 --> 12:36.278
Where?

12:39.449 --> 12:41.096
-It's okay. -Sorry?

12:41.551 --> 12:42.584
No need to compensate me.

15:18.075 --> 15:19.355
Mrs Meng and I are here

15:20.264 --> 15:21.304
to pick you up.

15:22.223 --> 15:23.544
And Yan Chen too.

15:24.548 --> 15:25.989
We are taking you home.

15:37.463 --> 15:38.463
Yan Chen,

15:39.544 --> 15:41.264
stay here with her.

15:41.503 --> 15:42.983
-Okay. -We'll be right back.

15:54.411 --> 15:55.411
Qin Qin,

15:57.496 --> 15:58.496
I'm your brother.

16:06.662 --> 16:08.863
Qin Qin, I like cleanliness.

16:09.209 --> 16:10.503
This is too dirty.

16:10.669 --> 16:11.669
Let's throw it away.

16:12.103 --> 16:13.103
Let's get rid of it.

16:22.743 --> 16:24.103
It's so dirty.

16:24.503 --> 16:25.503
Look.

16:26.223 --> 16:28.743
Your fingernails are all black.

16:29.024 --> 16:30.864
I am Meng Huai Jin, Xu Hai Shan's comrade.

16:31.081 --> 16:32.640
This is my wife, Fu Wen Ying.

16:33.282 --> 16:35.986
The Civil Affairs Bureau is working on our adoption procedures.

16:36.053 --> 16:38.147
We are taking the child home today.

16:49.144 --> 16:50.144
How did you...

16:50.784 --> 16:51.784
Yan Chen.

16:52.223 --> 16:53.663
-Let's go. -Okay.

16:56.305 --> 16:57.305
Come on.

17:19.129 --> 17:20.129
You're awake.

17:20.850 --> 17:22.370
You slept here last night?

17:25.156 --> 17:26.829
I cooked the dumplings in your fridge.

17:27.037 --> 17:28.037
Eat it while it's warm.

17:33.944 --> 17:34.944
Try it.

17:40.983 --> 17:43.490
The shrimps are quite big. It probably wrapped the whole one.

17:45.809 --> 17:47.895
-That's why I love eating this. -It really is good.

17:48.625 --> 17:49.625
I didn't expect

17:50.127 --> 17:52.361
you would get along so well with Zhan Xiao Yao.

17:53.463 --> 17:54.703
She's very likable.

17:56.456 --> 17:57.456
So are you.

18:04.523 --> 18:05.523
I'm annoying

18:07.242 --> 18:08.242
and unlikable.

18:10.547 --> 18:11.547
Qin Qin,

18:11.891 --> 18:12.891
don't say that.

18:15.903 --> 18:17.409
I tried to reconcile with Song Yan,

18:20.431 --> 18:21.431
but he turned me down.

18:29.837 --> 18:30.837
Actually,

18:32.969 --> 18:34.090
it's better that he did.

18:36.373 --> 18:37.572
If he had agreed,

18:39.777 --> 18:41.176
I wouldn't know what to do.

18:44.448 --> 18:46.448
I don't even dare to tell Mom.

18:50.551 --> 18:51.990
He must have realized it too.

18:53.950 --> 18:54.950
I wasn't resolute,

18:58.637 --> 19:00.036
so he detested me.

19:02.264 --> 19:04.143
I must have looked ugly at that time.

19:07.203 --> 19:08.203
Yan Chen,

19:09.003 --> 19:10.003
after I went abroad,

19:10.307 --> 19:11.673
did he ever write me a letter?

19:20.003 --> 19:21.003
It's okay.

19:34.131 --> 19:35.131
Keep eating.

19:35.799 --> 19:36.799
It's getting cold.

19:42.276 --> 19:43.516
Mom knows it's your off day.

19:45.009 --> 19:46.489
She asked me to tell you to go home.

19:50.095 --> 19:51.095
Got it.

20:30.686 --> 20:32.089
Take a 20-minute break right here.

20:32.288 --> 20:34.197
Next up, rope climbing.

20:36.899 --> 20:38.563
The break time in between is too short.

20:38.996 --> 20:40.315
Let them rest a little longer.

20:40.744 --> 20:41.744
Ten minutes.

20:42.623 --> 20:43.623
Ten...

20:49.718 --> 20:51.360
When parents argue,

20:51.441 --> 20:53.321
the ones who suffer are the unlucky children.

20:53.464 --> 20:54.504
-Just shut up. -I know.

20:54.522 --> 20:55.698
You know very well

20:55.779 --> 20:56.779
why they are fighting.

20:57.143 --> 20:58.343
Have some water.

21:47.464 --> 21:49.184
Hi, is there anyone home in 1101?

21:49.262 --> 21:50.262
We are the firefighters.

21:52.469 --> 21:53.469
Coming.

22:09.386 --> 22:10.386
Hi, Ms. Xu.

22:10.452 --> 22:12.775
They are from the firefighting force. The child from Unit 1201

22:12.855 --> 22:15.361
climbed out onto the balcony and got stuck on the air conditioning unit.

22:15.442 --> 22:16.482
His parents aren't home.

22:16.749 --> 22:18.150
Can we borrow your balcony?

22:19.663 --> 22:20.663
Please come in.

22:27.264 --> 22:28.943
Jiang, put on the gear.

22:47.491 --> 22:48.884
Set up another safety pivot point.

22:54.183 --> 22:55.183
Kid,

22:55.464 --> 22:57.264
I got you now. I'm holding onto you.

22:58.744 --> 22:59.903
Don't move, okay?

23:03.903 --> 23:04.943
You mustn't move.

23:05.504 --> 23:06.504
What's your name?

23:07.943 --> 23:10.103
Liu... Liu Si Qi.

23:10.843 --> 23:11.922
Liu Si Qi,

23:12.744 --> 23:13.777
it's a really good name.

23:14.151 --> 23:15.151
You are very brave.

23:15.517 --> 23:16.787
As long as you don't move,

23:16.863 --> 23:18.143
you stay still,

23:19.064 --> 23:20.464
we will get you up in no time.

23:30.504 --> 23:32.445
Ready. It's okay, it's okay.

23:32.469 --> 23:33.469
Push him up!

23:43.663 --> 23:44.663
Come.

23:45.148 --> 23:46.148
Easy.

23:46.264 --> 23:47.824
Lower. Easy.

23:48.064 --> 23:49.064
Hold him.

24:07.423 --> 24:08.423
Hurry, hurry.

24:10.103 --> 24:11.103
Easy.

24:12.264 --> 24:13.064
-Are you okay? -Are you okay, Captain?

24:13.103 --> 24:14.103
I'm fine.

24:16.813 --> 24:17.813
Come on.

24:26.304 --> 24:28.544
Don't cry. Daddy and Mommy are going to be here soon.

24:28.625 --> 24:29.945
Sorry for the trouble.

24:33.723 --> 24:34.723
Okay, hang in there.

24:34.765 --> 24:36.084
The pain will go away soon.

24:38.164 --> 24:39.203
Stretch your arm.

24:54.544 --> 24:55.663
Come here.

24:55.744 --> 24:56.744
Thank you, thank you.

24:56.885 --> 25:00.104
-Let me. Captain, are you okay? -I'm fine.

25:00.691 --> 25:01.691
Don't worry.

25:06.090 --> 25:07.109
You are such a brave boy.

25:12.769 --> 25:14.644
-Done. -Done.

25:30.383 --> 25:32.264
Qi Qi! Qi Qi!

25:32.956 --> 25:33.956
My baby boy!

25:34.291 --> 25:35.291
Slow down.

25:35.590 --> 25:36.590
Are you hurt?

25:37.004 --> 25:38.324
You scared Mommy.

25:38.393 --> 25:40.288
Don't be afraid, Qi Qi. Daddy is here now.

25:40.910 --> 25:43.111
-Thank you. -Thank you.

25:43.703 --> 25:44.703
Listen,

25:44.903 --> 25:46.729
don't leave your child alone at home again.

25:47.383 --> 25:49.792
We've been really busy with work.

25:49.873 --> 25:51.192
We had no other choice today.

25:51.541 --> 25:52.901
We will never do this again.

25:53.690 --> 25:55.411
And seal off your balcony.

25:55.504 --> 25:56.944
-It's too dangerous. -Yes, yes.

25:57.024 --> 25:58.744
The glass has been broken for a long time.

25:58.824 --> 26:00.234
This is your fault.

26:00.315 --> 26:02.370
I kept telling you to seal it, yet you just put a net there.

26:02.451 --> 26:03.620
What good does it do?

26:03.819 --> 26:05.922
I shouldn't have been careless. I'm sorry for the trouble.

26:05.988 --> 26:07.875
-Thank you. -Don't forget that.

26:07.956 --> 26:09.715
Take your son to the hospital for an examination first.

26:09.796 --> 26:11.197
Say thank you to them now. Go on.

26:11.395 --> 26:13.309
Thank you, sir. Thank you, ma'am.

26:13.856 --> 26:15.143
We are leaving now. Thank you.

26:15.297 --> 26:16.967
-Seal off your balcony immediately. -I will, I will.

26:17.033 --> 26:18.593
Ms. Xu, thank you for your help.

26:19.136 --> 26:20.136
Thank you for your help.

26:32.215 --> 26:33.215
Hi.

26:33.991 --> 26:35.824
Can you give me Song Yan's WeChat ID?

26:37.633 --> 26:39.155
-I... -Please.

26:40.464 --> 26:41.884
Don't tell him you got it from me.

26:42.492 --> 26:43.492
Thank you.

27:02.846 --> 27:03.846
It's all done.

27:05.749 --> 27:07.102
Have a cup of tea before you go.

27:07.416 --> 27:08.628
You've sweated a lot just now.

27:08.709 --> 27:09.709
You need to rehydrate.

27:11.409 --> 27:12.409
It's a bit hot.

27:12.989 --> 27:14.249
Why don't you sit for a while?

27:15.029 --> 27:16.029
Never mind.

27:16.591 --> 27:17.995
I should go and pack up the equipment.

27:18.063 --> 27:19.222
Let me treat your wound.

27:22.466 --> 27:23.466
Have a seat.

27:38.776 --> 27:39.976
You hurt your wrist, right?

27:43.036 --> 27:44.036
Give me your hand.

28:41.478 --> 28:42.599
Are you

28:43.384 --> 28:44.424
usually busy with work?

28:46.249 --> 28:47.249
It's all right.

28:47.783 --> 28:50.010
There's always something to do every day, big or small.

28:50.983 --> 28:51.983
Not as busy as you.

28:52.516 --> 28:54.676
I'm currently on rotation in the emergency department.

28:54.996 --> 28:56.449
Otherwise, I wouldn't be this busy.

28:56.583 --> 28:57.583
Besides,

28:57.828 --> 28:58.828
our work

28:59.209 --> 29:00.530
is not as dangerous as yours.

29:01.831 --> 29:03.463
Your work can also be dangerous enough.

29:05.135 --> 29:06.135
Done.

29:07.709 --> 29:08.709
Thanks.

29:28.210 --> 29:29.210
Thanks.

29:33.570 --> 29:34.570
I should go.

29:49.082 --> 29:50.082
Bye bye.

30:38.829 --> 30:39.829
Song Yan!

30:53.663 --> 30:55.583
You're off this weekend, right?

31:30.278 --> 31:31.278
According to this development trend,

31:31.343 --> 31:34.064
we can achieve an annual return on investment of 18%.

31:34.349 --> 31:37.423
After five years, the project's profit can reach 135 million.

31:40.143 --> 31:42.583
How can we guarantee an 18% return on investment?

31:43.755 --> 31:44.979
We conducted market research.

31:45.060 --> 31:47.572
The local property prices are high and still have room to rise.

31:47.664 --> 31:50.933
Moreover, their company's property sales proceeds are currently flowing smoothly.

31:53.637 --> 31:55.238
The most common mistake investors make

31:55.704 --> 31:58.744
is believing that recent trends will continue,

32:00.275 --> 32:02.179
assuming that what seems like a good investment now

32:02.245 --> 32:04.458
will definitely remain a good investment in the future.

32:04.879 --> 32:06.000
Past high returns only prove

32:06.081 --> 32:08.183
that the asset will become more expensive.

32:09.152 --> 32:10.912
If you treat it as an investment target,

32:11.062 --> 32:12.183
it will only get worse,

32:12.264 --> 32:13.264
not better.

32:14.591 --> 32:15.751
Neither political factors

32:15.976 --> 32:16.976
nor human factors

32:17.294 --> 32:18.894
can eliminate economic cycles.

32:19.563 --> 32:20.983
There will always be a reckoning.

32:21.103 --> 32:22.103
Next.

32:30.540 --> 32:31.627
Yunji Pharmaceuticals.

32:33.110 --> 32:34.830
This company primarily focuses on

32:34.909 --> 32:36.442
the research and development (R&D) of anti-cancer drugs.

32:36.523 --> 32:38.144
The initial investment-to-output ratio

32:38.224 --> 32:39.303
may not be very promising,

32:39.383 --> 32:40.824
but in the long run,

32:41.418 --> 32:43.064
I have great confidence in this company.

32:43.610 --> 32:45.136
Have you visited their R&D center?

32:45.676 --> 32:47.658
Yes, I have. Their owner was very welcoming.

32:47.744 --> 32:49.183
You can go and visit to learn more.

32:49.504 --> 32:51.264
What about the list of company management?

32:51.389 --> 32:53.030
They are on page 23 in the folder.

32:58.500 --> 32:59.670
And the list of R&D personnel?

32:59.757 --> 33:01.037
Pages 46 to 57.

33:06.808 --> 33:08.997
Set up an appointment for me. Book a flight ticket.

33:09.644 --> 33:11.908
Mr. Meng, the financial statements of this company

33:11.989 --> 33:13.997
are not viewed favorably in the market.

33:14.962 --> 33:16.202
Investors must always remember

33:16.787 --> 33:18.186
that what we pay is the price,

33:18.469 --> 33:19.679
and what we get is the value.

33:20.663 --> 33:22.396
A good company will shine eventually.

33:22.893 --> 33:24.252
Before that,

33:24.590 --> 33:25.686
all we need to do is wait.

33:34.984 --> 33:36.383
Excuse me for a bit.

34:14.444 --> 34:15.444
(Song Yan)

35:19.990 --> 35:21.812
Dr. Yang, that's a nice purse.

35:22.346 --> 35:23.722
Your new haircut looks good too.

35:27.884 --> 35:28.884
New haircut?

35:30.851 --> 35:31.931
I haven't made any changes.

35:47.804 --> 35:49.009
(Song Yan)

35:53.784 --> 35:54.809
(Song Yan)

36:00.124 --> 36:01.237
(Yes?)

36:26.203 --> 36:29.230
(Thanks for helping me clean the house.)

36:31.748 --> 36:34.782
(Again? You've thanked me twice.)

36:40.824 --> 36:41.824
Dr. Xu.

36:42.144 --> 36:43.144
We need you.

36:58.489 --> 37:00.409
(Yan, Mom said the weather is getting cold.)

37:00.711 --> 37:02.563
(She wants me to bring you some warm clothes.)

37:02.677 --> 37:03.847
(I'll come find you later.)

37:03.943 --> 37:06.096
(If you're not around, I'll leave them with Suo Jun.)

37:07.904 --> 37:11.096
No need. If I'm not around, just leave them at the security post.

38:45.337 --> 38:47.329
-Hello, Mom. -(You can't come home again)

38:47.584 --> 38:48.865
(on Sunday?)

38:49.186 --> 38:50.332
(Are you really that busy?)

38:51.088 --> 38:52.794
There is some work I need to take care of.

38:54.622 --> 38:57.304
Do you have any disagreements with the shareholders of your company?

38:57.894 --> 38:58.934
What's the issue?

39:01.431 --> 39:02.431
Not really.

39:03.291 --> 39:04.950
They probably just have some objections

39:05.102 --> 39:06.102
to one of my decisions.

39:07.835 --> 39:09.773
You've been doing a good job these past two years

39:09.840 --> 39:11.639
and haven't made any major mistakes,

39:12.209 --> 39:13.209
(but...)

39:13.377 --> 39:14.377
Mom,

39:15.016 --> 39:16.056
I know what I'm doing.

39:20.516 --> 39:21.757
Are you driving?

39:22.586 --> 39:23.666
We will talk later.

39:23.985 --> 39:25.937
-(You should focus on the road.) -Okay.

39:36.684 --> 39:37.684
I say, Wen Ying,

39:38.266 --> 39:40.237
aren't you meddling too much?

39:41.371 --> 39:43.010
Don't meddle in his company's affairs.

39:43.306 --> 39:45.473
Let's not get involved with his work.

39:45.575 --> 39:46.782
I'm doing this for your sake.

39:47.477 --> 39:48.477
If our son

39:48.578 --> 39:49.898
can take over earlier,

39:50.436 --> 39:51.837
you won't have to work so hard.

39:53.150 --> 39:54.150
Let's take it slow.

39:55.270 --> 39:57.824
Given my current health, I can work for another ten years or so.

39:58.321 --> 39:59.321
You should

40:00.404 --> 40:01.444
worry a little less.

40:25.215 --> 40:26.215
Enter.

40:28.251 --> 40:29.251
Mr. Yan Chen,

40:29.857 --> 40:31.857
these are the financial statements of Xingya.

40:32.089 --> 40:33.301
Please sign on the last page.

40:39.396 --> 40:42.863
By the way, the investment signing ceremony with Yunji is also ready.

40:46.602 --> 40:47.602
Chen Ming Yu.

40:48.572 --> 40:49.572
Who's your boss?

40:53.844 --> 40:54.844
Who's your boss?

40:59.996 --> 41:00.996
Mr. Yan Chen,

41:01.777 --> 41:02.777
you are my boss.

41:04.221 --> 41:05.221
Am I?

41:10.624 --> 41:12.263
Mr. Meng has never

41:12.496 --> 41:13.696
asked me about your work.

41:18.943 --> 41:19.943
Well,

41:20.637 --> 41:22.117
Mrs. Meng asked about it once.

41:22.469 --> 41:24.149
But I didn't...

41:28.578 --> 41:30.018
I'm sorry, Mr. Yan Chen.

41:38.255 --> 41:39.255
Maybe I should

41:39.304 --> 41:41.023
arrange for you to work for her instead.

41:42.503 --> 41:43.503
No, please.

41:45.228 --> 41:46.428
I've learned my lesson.

41:48.323 --> 41:49.323
Mr. Yan Chen.

41:57.063 --> 41:58.063
You may leave.

42:02.304 --> 42:03.304
Thank you, Mr. Yan Chen.

42:21.463 --> 42:22.504
Water Gunner Number 1,

42:22.699 --> 42:23.978
Zhan Da Peng, in position!

42:32.543 --> 42:33.543
Hey, Chi,

42:34.184 --> 42:35.184
what task did you get?

42:36.304 --> 42:39.728
Nothing major. Just someone's head stuck in a fence.

42:41.983 --> 42:44.617
When can we also get assigned a task? It would be great to have a big one.

42:44.654 --> 42:46.640
Brat, shut your mouth.

42:46.664 --> 42:47.737
Don't jinx it like me.

42:49.383 --> 42:50.383
Don't worry, Yi,

42:50.496 --> 42:52.002
I wouldn't dare take your nickname.

42:53.343 --> 42:54.624
You got quite a bad reputation.

42:54.943 --> 42:55.943
It's experience.

42:56.023 --> 42:57.903
What are you doing up there? Get down!

42:57.983 --> 42:58.983
Yes, Captain.

43:00.903 --> 43:01.903
Yang Chi,

43:01.972 --> 43:03.253
please maintain the car later.

43:05.843 --> 43:07.643
Captain, you have a visitor at the door.

43:08.245 --> 43:09.245
Pardon me?

43:10.047 --> 43:11.826
There is a girl waiting for you at the door.

43:15.383 --> 43:17.476
It's my sister. She's just here to bring me clothes.

43:18.488 --> 43:19.488
Excuse me.

43:22.759 --> 43:25.184
Listen, Captain's sister looks pretty cute.

43:25.410 --> 43:26.930
She's perky. Not bad at all.

43:26.989 --> 43:28.270
I don't think that's his sister.

43:29.866 --> 43:31.224
I think it's that female doctor.

43:32.144 --> 43:34.110
-Female doctor? -That female doctor?

43:35.369 --> 43:37.581
-Why are we still here then? Let's go! -Come on.

43:37.605 --> 43:38.694
It's none of your business. Get back to your training.

43:38.775 --> 43:39.775
I'm coming too.
